{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266ytV7dgceh1795792426.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國股市在感恩節假期後復市，三大指數全線高開，早段曾升逾百分之1。</p><p></p><p>道指曾升逾500點，迫近50,700點前有阻力，指數升幅收窄。納指早段升逾370點，曾升近24,000點大關。</p><p></p><p>人工智能板塊向好，晶片商閃迪早段升約百分之8。美光科技升逾百分之2。輝達升近百分之2，其後倒跌。美國人工智能企業Anthropic，曾升約百分之3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:24:43.245659+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T15:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:32:40.949276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:38.540782+00:00","content_hash":"9f64d106c7aec9d768894137138195a29b1c6672bd8377aecfed43b6013cd780","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:24:43.245659+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}